From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a webview's pickers are the shell's

Chrome drew a page's color, date and time pickers as page popups of
its own, and a text input's <datalist> through autofill, which a guest
has none of. A page's frame now asks its <webview>'s shell instead,
through domicile::mojom::PagePicker, and the shell draws the picker.

- `chrome_client_impl.cc`: OpenColorChooser, OpenDateTimeChooser and
  OpenTextDataListChooser use the shell's pickers in every document but
  the shell's own (domicile_page_picker.h).
- `chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc`: binds PagePicker for a frame
  in a guest, to its WebViewGuest.
- Blink build lists: domicile_page_picker, DomicilePickerEvent.
---
 .../chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc       | 17 +++++++++++++++
 .../renderer/bindings/generated_in_core.gni   |  2 ++
 .../blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_core.gni   |  1 +
 .../blink/renderer/core/html/build.gni        |  4 ++++
 .../renderer/core/page/chrome_client_impl.cc  | 21 +++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 45 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc
index 1f3e82d..9ea049d 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders.cc
@@ -745,6 +745,23 @@ void PopulateChromeFrameBinders(
             base::BindOnce(&domicile::BindAppChannel, std::move(receiver)));
       }));
 
+  // Domicile's engine fork: a page's pickers for its form controls (color,
+  // date and time, a <datalist>), which the shell draws. See
+  // WebViewGuest::Pick.
+  //
+  // Any page in a guest may ask: it is the page's own control. A frame outside
+  // every guest has no shell to ask, so its pipe is dropped and the page
+  // keeps its value.
+  map->Add<domicile::mojom::PagePicker>(base::BindRepeating(
+      [](content::RenderFrameHost* frame,
+         mojo::PendingReceiver<domicile::mojom::PagePicker> receiver) {
+        domicile::WebViewGuest* guest = domicile::WebViewGuest::FromWebContents(
+            content::WebContents::FromRenderFrameHost(frame));
+        if (guest) {
+          guest->BindPagePicker(*frame, std::move(receiver));
+        }
+      }));
+
   map->Add<image_annotation::mojom::Annotator>(&BindImageAnnotator);
 
   map->Add<blink::mojom::ScriptToolHost>(
